params:
  code: CH
  nom: Switzerland
  gentilé: Swiss
commun . mix électrique . empreinte carbone:
  titre: Carbon intensity of the Swiss electricity mix
  formule: 0.091
  note: |
    Calculation carried out by the State of Geneva (OCEN – DDC), taking into account locally generated renewable electricity, which accounts for around one-third of the canton’s electricity consumption, and the average Swiss consumer mix (KBOB) for electricity imported from the grid, based on the 2017–2021 average (5 years).
transport . voiture . km:
  description: |
    Only include kilometres travelled for personal purposes (shopping, leisure, family, etc.) and for travelling between home and your usual place of work.

    For example, if you are on a business trip to another canton or another country, this is covered by your company’s records: do not include it here.
  par défaut: 6000
transport . voiture . km annuels moyen:
  formule: 6000
  note: |
    Source: <a href="https://www.bfs.admin.ch/bfs/fr/home/statistiques/mobilite-transports/transport-personnes/comportements-transports/distance-duree-jour-deplacements.html">Federal Statistical Office</a>.
transport . voiture . gabarit . petite:
  titre: Small
  description: City car such as the Renault Zoé or Fiat 500
transport . voiture . gabarit . moyenne:
  titre: Average
  description: A model in the segment above the small city car, such as the Renault Mégane or VW Golf
transport . voiture . gabarit . VUL:
  titre: Commercial vehicle
  description: VW Multivan or Mercedes Vito-type van or minibus
transport . voiture . gabarit . berline:
  titre: Saloon
  description: A saloon car such as the Peugeot 508, Tesla Model 3, Audi A4 or A6
transport . voiture . gabarit . SUV:
  titre: SUV
  description: |
    "Sport utility vehicle", urban 4x4 type
transport . voiture . thermique . carburant:
  description: |
    To understand the different types of fuel, [this informative article](https://www.francetvinfo.fr/economie/automobile/essence/les-carburants-changent-de-nom-a-la-pompe-voici-comment-vous-y-retrouver_2967013.html) is very useful.

    &gt; Please note that whilst the type of fuel can significantly affect the carbon footprint per litre, fuel consumption in litres per 100 km also varies. Make sure you enter a fuel consumption figure in litres based on your actual average.
transport . voiture . thermique . carburant . gazole B7 ou B10:
  titre: Diesel
transport . voiture . thermique . carburant . essence E5 ou E10:
  titre: Petrol
transport . voiture . thermique . carburant . essence E85:
  titre: E85 petrol
transport . deux roues . km annuels moyen:
  formule: 320
transport . deux roues . empreinte moyenne:
  valeur: deux roues . empreinte
  contexte:
    deux roues . usager: oui
    deux roues . type: "'moto sup 250'"
    deux roues . km: 400
  note: MRMT 2021, figures adjusted on the basis of the 2022 counts to correct for the COVID effect observed in 2021.
transport . avion . usager:
  description: |
    We have chosen to offer you the option of calculating the impact of your air travel over several years. The climate impact is such that it is important to take this into account.

    So, whether or not you fly every year, please answer ‘yes’ and you’ll then have the option to enter your flight times for the last three years.

    &gt; 💡 If you flew from Zurich to New York in 2023 (approximately 19 hours return), your associated emissions (nearly 2 tonnes) will be spread over the last three years.
transport . avion . court courrier . durée moyenne:
  titre: Average time spent by a Swiss traveller on short-haul flights
  formule: 0.024 * 9000 km / vitesse moyenne
  unité: h
transport . avion . court courrier . durée moyenne passager:
  titre: Average time spent by a Swiss passenger on short-haul flights
  formule: 0.024 * 9000 km / vitesse moyenne
  unité: h
transport . avion . moyen et long courrier . durée moyenne:
  titre: Average time spent by a Swiss traveller on medium-haul and long-haul flights
  formule: 0.976 * 9000 km / vitesse moyenne
  unité: h
transport . avion . moyen et long courrier . durée moyenne passager:
  titre: Average time spent by a Swiss passenger on medium-haul and long-haul flights
  formule: 0.976 * 9000 km / vitesse moyenne
  unité: h
transport . avion . vols annuels:
  mosaique:
    type: nombre
    options:
      - heures court courrier . saisie
      - heures moyen et long courrier . saisie
    suggestions: null
transport . avion . vols amortis:
  mosaique:
    type: nombre
    options:
      - heures court courrier . saisie
      - heures moyen et long courrier . saisie
    suggestions: null
transport . train . km:
  suggestions:
    Geneva ⇄ Nyon: 42
    Geneva ⇄ Lausanne: 100
    Geneva ⇄ Bern: 260
    Geneva ⇄ Zurich: 440
    Geneva ⇄ Paris: 820
  par défaut: 2700
transport . transports commun . métro ou tram . heures par semaine:
  question: How many hours a week do you spend on the tram?
transport . avion . court courrier . empreinte par km:
  formule: 0.305 kgCO2e/km
  description: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html
transport . avion . moyen et long courrier . empreinte par km:
  formule: (0.257 kgCO2e/km + 0.235 kgCO2e/km) / 2
  description: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html
transport . train . impact par km:
  formule: 0.002
  note: We use the emission factor from the Mobitool platform – Mobitool SBB electric mix (excluding road infrastructure)
transport . transports commun . métro ou tram . impact par km:
  formule: 0.021
  note: We use the emission factor from the Mobitool platform – Mobitool tramway (excluding infrastructure)
transport . transports commun . métro ou tram . vitesse:
  formule: 15.4
  note: TPG (2022 Management Report – medium-speed commercial tram)
transport . transports commun . bus . impact par km:
  formule: 0.067
  note: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform – Mobitool, based on the TPG fleet (2022 Management Report – 30% trolleybuses, 70% buses, mainly articulated)
transport . transports commun . bus . vitesse:
  formule: 18
  note: TPG (2022 Management Report – estimate based on bus operating speed)
transport . deux roues . empreinte:
  formule:
    variations:
      - si: type = 'scooter thermique'
        alors: 0.124
      - si: type = 'scooter électrique'
        alors: 0.03
      - si: type = 'moto inf 250'
        alors: 0.146
      - si: type = 'moto sup 250'
        alors: 0.194
  note: |
    We use the emission factor from the Mobitool platform – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html

    - Mobitool average scooter (excluding infrastructure, including construction)
    - SMobitool motorbike 11–35 kW (excluding infrastructure, including construction)
    - Mobitool motorbike >35 kW (excluding infrastructure, including construction)
transport . voiture . électrique . empreinte au kilomètre:
  formule:
    variations:
      - si: gabarit = 'petite'
        alors: 0.021
      - si: gabarit = 'moyenne'
        alors: 0.024
      - sinon: 0.028
  note: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html
transport . voiture . barème construction . barème thermique:
  formule:
    variations:
      - si:
          une de ces conditions:
            - gabarit = 'petite'
            - gabarit = 'moyenne'
        alors: 7758
      - si: gabarit = 'VUL'
        alors: 10340
      - si: gabarit = 'berline'
        alors: 8958
      - si: gabarit = 'SUV'
        alors: 11722
  note: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform ((manufacture + maintenance + end-of-life) * km * number of passengers) – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html
transport . voiture . barème construction . barème électrique:
  formule:
    variations:
      - si:
          une de ces conditions:
            - gabarit = 'petite'
            - gabarit = 'moyenne'
        alors: 11013
      - si: gabarit = 'VUL'
        alors: 16093
      - si: gabarit = 'berline'
        alors: 13291
      - si: gabarit = 'SUV'
        alors: 18895
  note: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform ((manufacture + maintenance + end-of-life) * km * number of passengers) – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html
transport . voiture . barème construction . barème hybride:
  formule:
    variations:
      - si:
          une de ces conditions:
            - gabarit = 'petite'
            - gabarit = 'moyenne'
        alors: 8880
      - si: gabarit = 'VUL'
        alors: 11957
      - si: gabarit = 'berline'
        alors: 10298
      - si: gabarit = 'SUV'
        alors: 13616
  note: We use the emission factor provided by the Mobitool platform ((manufacture + maintenance + end-of-life) * km * number of passengers) – https://www.mobitool.ch/fr/outils/facteurs-mobitool-v2-1-25.html
