alimentation . plats:
  question: Choose the dishes for your lunch and dinner for a typical week
alimentation . local . consommation:
  description: null
alimentation . de saison . consommation:
  description: |
    This question enables us to adjust your dietary profile based on your shopping habits in relation to seasonal produce.
alimentation . déchets . quantité jetée:
  description: |
    &gt; Please only select ‘Zero Waste’ if you keep track of every single item of waste. To find out more about zero-waste lifestyles, visit the Zero Waste Genève website.

    &gt; Please note that even if you commit to a ‘zero waste’ lifestyle, we still take greenhouse gas emissions into account (albeit significantly reduced), as it is very difficult
    or even impossible to generate no waste at all; some waste is invisible and unavoidable.
logement . âge:
  description: |
    In the canton of Geneva, more than half of residential buildings and detached houses were built before 1980.
